# A PAT that can register self-hosted runners for the autobleem2 organisation:
#  - a classic PAT with the `admin:org` scope, OR
#  - a fine-grained PAT scoped to the autobleem2 org with "Self-hosted runners: read and write".
# The runner registers and re-registers itself with it. Never commit the filled-in .env.
ACCESS_TOKEN=
# where the runner keeps its checkouts and build dirs - the same path inside and outside the container
RUNNER_WORK=/home/claude/actions-runner/work
